    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1194">

                <pb facs="0966" n="850" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/6972.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Navy to Admiral
                    Winslow</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 24, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department desires expeditionary force be sent with least possible delay to
                    Topolobampo. <hi rendition="#italic">Maryland</hi> will be placed in reserve
                    immediately, and <hi rendition="#italic">Buffalo</hi> and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bushnell</hi> placed in commission with her personnel.
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Buffalo</hi> will be sent to Topolobampo as soon as
                    available and marines at San Diego will be embarked on her if considered
                    necessary at that time. Order <hi rendition="#italic">Maryland</hi> San
                    Francisco. Embark San Francisco marines on <hi rendition="#italic">San
                        Diego</hi> and proceed with least possible delay Topolobampo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Daniels.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
